            </profile>
            <profile id="dbcb-a76c-885e-8305" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, pike, light armour and shield. May have heavy armour (+1). Macedonian Phalanx. There must be at least one Epirote unit for every Macedonian unit. Guards are Stubborn and may exchange pike for thrusting spear and javelins (free). If they take this option and do not have heavy armour, they may fight as Light Infantry. There must be at least one phalanx unit in the army.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="8a79-492c-daee-a3c9" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
