              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, javelins and buckler. All Peltasts may upgrade to Shield (+1) and are Light Infantry. All other types listed here are Skirmishers. Aetolians have Feigned Flight. Every second Mercenary skirmisher unit may exchange javelins and buckler for composite bow (+1).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="e0d1-34f6-b82f-ca63" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
