              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, javelins and buckler. All Peltasts may upgrade to Shield (+1) and are Light Infantry. All other types listed here are Skirmishers. Cretans have composite bow and buckler in place of javelins and buckler; Rhodian slingers exchange javelins for sling. This unit must be the smallest skirmish unit in the army.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
