              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each machine has a crew of 2 men armed with hand weapons. May add an additional crewman for +10 points. They may have light armour (+2) per crewman. There may be no more than one artillery piece per infantry unit in the army.</characteristic>
